WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:04.567
-Welcome back. Jamie Dornan
is joining us right here.

00:00:04.567 --> 00:00:08.033
We're talking about
his new movie, "Belfast."

00:00:08.033 --> 00:00:09.801
You know, there was
a big premiere

00:00:09.801 --> 00:00:11.901
for "Belfast" in Belfast.

00:00:11.901 --> 00:00:13.400
-Yep.
-What was that like?

00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:15.901
-Listen. It was one of
the best nights of my life.

00:00:15.901 --> 00:00:19.701
It was -- I -- I felt like
vomiting for the whole day.

00:00:19.701 --> 00:00:21.267
Like, I have never --
I get nervous

00:00:21.267 --> 00:00:23.067
before kind of everything --
this.

00:00:23.067 --> 00:00:25.267
Everything -- Even this.
-Yeah.

00:00:25.267 --> 00:00:28.367
-No, I really get, like,
a sick feeling in my stomach

00:00:28.367 --> 00:00:30.667
when you are about to put
something out there like that.

00:00:30.667 --> 00:00:32.200
But particularly for the --

00:00:32.200 --> 00:00:33.834
doing it for the people of home,
you know.

00:00:33.834 --> 00:00:35.934
This -- This movie
means so much to them.

00:00:35.934 --> 00:00:37.834
-Was there family and friends
there?

00:00:37.834 --> 00:00:39.467
-We have family and some
of my best mates there.

00:00:39.467 --> 00:00:43.267
1,400, you know, people
from Belfast,

00:00:43.267 --> 00:00:44.501
so it was a special night.

00:00:44.501 --> 00:00:46.000
-Wow.
-Yeah, it was class. Yeah.

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:48.968
-I got to say the cast
was amazing and the chemistry.

00:00:48.968 --> 00:00:50.801
But that little --
the little kid.

00:00:50.801 --> 00:00:51.834
-Oh. Stop.

00:00:51.834 --> 00:00:53.701
-What -- Jude Hill.

00:00:53.701 --> 00:00:55.567
-Yeah. Jude Hill.
He's incredible. He's only --

00:00:55.567 --> 00:00:57.567
-It's got to be his first.
-It's his first ever.

00:00:57.567 --> 00:01:00.267
And I think -- Yeah, he -- he'd
done a lot of Irish dancing.

00:01:00.267 --> 00:01:02.033
That was only the sort of
performative thing

00:01:02.033 --> 00:01:05.200
that he'd done,
and he just steals every scene,

00:01:05.200 --> 00:01:06.634
as you -- as you've noticed.

00:01:06.634 --> 00:01:07.968
-He's so --
-Incredible.

00:01:07.968 --> 00:01:09.868
His face, man. His face.
-Cute. Everything about him.

00:01:09.868 --> 00:01:11.367
You're like, "Oh, my gosh."
Did he love it?

00:01:11.367 --> 00:01:12.868
-And he's really cheeky.
He's really cheeky.

00:01:12.868 --> 00:01:13.934
-He is, right?
-Yeah.

00:01:13.934 --> 00:01:15.601
-But I keep telling him
to embrace it.

00:01:15.601 --> 00:01:17.200
You need that
to get through life, I think.

00:01:17.200 --> 00:01:18.567
-Exactly right.
Yeah, you got to be --

00:01:18.567 --> 00:01:20.934
You got to be silly, man.
Absolutely. Yeah.

00:01:20.934 --> 00:01:22.901
And then you have Judi Dench.
-Yeah.

00:01:22.901 --> 00:01:24.234
-Hitting a homer.
-Yeah.

00:01:24.234 --> 00:01:25.467
-Like she wouldn't.

00:01:25.467 --> 00:01:26.834
But I mean --
-No. I know.

00:01:26.834 --> 00:01:28.467
Well, when I signed on,

00:01:28.467 --> 00:01:30.300
it was only Judi Dench attached
at that point.

00:01:30.300 --> 00:01:32.300
I was like, "I don't need
to read the script.

00:01:32.300 --> 00:01:33.634
Like, I'm doing it.
I don't care."

00:01:33.634 --> 00:01:34.934
-Yeah.
Yeah, no matter what it is.

00:01:34.934 --> 00:01:37.167
-I don't care what I'm doing in
a Judi Dench film, but, like --

00:01:37.167 --> 00:01:38.300
-"But I'm doing it."

00:01:38.300 --> 00:01:39.734
-If I'm playing her son,
I'm definitely doing it.

00:01:39.734 --> 00:01:41.367
-What a great look she had, too.
-Incredible.

00:01:41.367 --> 00:01:43.434
-They did a great job --
hair and makeup.

00:01:43.434 --> 00:01:44.734
-Yeah, she is amazing.

00:01:44.734 --> 00:01:47.267
-Is she just awesome
to be around?

00:01:47.267 --> 00:01:49.934
-Ciarán Hinds, who plays my dad
in it, he sums her up perfectly.

00:01:49.934 --> 00:01:51.701
He says she's a rebel.
She does --

00:01:51.701 --> 00:01:54.934
She has this, like, rebellious,
like, cheeky, like, mischievous

00:01:54.934 --> 00:01:57.501
side to her,
And she's, like, 87, Judi.

00:01:57.501 --> 00:01:59.834
-And she just --
she comes ready to play.

00:01:59.834 --> 00:02:01.367
You know,
it's very fun to be around.

00:02:01.367 --> 00:02:03.133
-I feel like I would
just ask her any question

00:02:03.133 --> 00:02:04.534
just to have her
tell me something.

00:02:04.534 --> 00:02:06.133
Be like, "Yeah,
I'm going to have coffee.

00:02:06.133 --> 00:02:08.133
Should I put anything in it?
What do you think, Judi?"

00:02:08.133 --> 00:02:10.734
-She will never steer you
the wrong way.

00:02:10.734 --> 00:02:12.067
-Right?
-No, no.

00:02:12.067 --> 00:02:13.234
-She won't.
-She's incredible.

00:02:13.234 --> 00:02:14.567
Incredible woman.
-Class. Class act.

00:02:14.567 --> 00:02:16.167
I want to show everyone a clip.

00:02:16.167 --> 00:02:18.100
Here is Jamie Dornan
in "Belfast."

00:02:18.100 --> 00:02:20.367
Take a look at this.

00:02:20.367 --> 00:02:24.167
-These boys are suffering.

00:02:24.167 --> 00:02:27.801
I don't think we've got
till Easter.

00:02:27.801 --> 00:02:29.701
[ Thunder rumbles ]

00:02:29.701 --> 00:02:32.100
I don't think you and me
have got till Easter, either.

00:02:37.634 --> 00:02:40.400
-I'll come home.

00:02:40.400 --> 00:02:43.601
We'll fight this together.

00:02:43.601 --> 00:02:45.334
-Kids the same age as ours

00:02:45.334 --> 00:02:48.234
are getting killed
or in the quarter.

00:02:49.968 --> 00:02:51.501
-We'll -- We'll be careful.

00:02:54.033 --> 00:02:57.868
-You can't be with them
24 hours a day.

00:02:57.868 --> 00:03:01.167
You can't take away
their childhood either.

00:03:01.167 --> 00:03:03.901
-[ Cheers and applause ]
-Jamie Dornan, everybody.

00:03:03.901 --> 00:03:06.968
"Belfast" is in select theaters
and on demand now.

